    <h2 id="section-1" style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 30px;">1. Detailed Comparison: Completion Certificate (CC) vs Occupancy Certificate (OC)</h2>
    <p>Although the terms Completion Certificate and Occupancy Certificate are frequently used interchangeably by real estate buyers, Indian municipal laws distinguish between these two certificates based on construction completion stages and occupancy permissions:</p>

